\\ A peer with no durable store (EFFECTS.md §12.3). It serves the two read-only
\\ operations of Rates from what its image has: constants and arithmetic. A
\\ peer image without a store may serve read-only operations only, and its
\\ program may not mention StoreWrite at all; this one uses no store effect.
\\ The request names its operation, so one peer serves both.

(include "rates.decl.fen")

(define percent {(Tuple I64 I64) --> I64}
  whole part -> (/ (* whole part) 100))

(serve Rates
  ((base u) -> 250)
  ((cap u) -> (+ 250 (percent 250 20))))
